# Azure Data Protection: Backup and Site Recovery - Complete Guide

> **Executive Summary:** Enterprise business continuity relies on two foundational pillars: **Azure Backup** (protecting data against accidental deletion, corruption, and ransomware) and **Azure Site Recovery / ASR** (protecting applications and virtual machines against regional outages and hardware disasters by orchestrating replication and failover).

